 lên"},{"question":"Chọn từ đúng cho nghĩa: sự cắt bỏ","options":["절제술","절규","주전자","증여"],"answer_index":0,"explanation":"절제술 = sự cắt bỏ"}],"common":[],"grammar":[],"mixed":[]},"source":"offline","media":{"vocab_audio":{},"dialogue_audio":{}},"media_map":{}}